Approach: sort the array and then apply twoSum approach to find the target. Now here this question stated that there should not be any duplicate values so to ensure it we need three checks one for i, other for left and last one for right. for i: i>o && nums[i]==nums[i-1] continue;
for left: while(left<right && nums[left]==nums[left-1]) left++
for right : while(left<right && nums[right]==nums[right-1]) right--;

Also remember to move left and right pointers when sum == target
